# Hotel Reservation Management System

## Overview

A relational database project developed using MySQL to manage hotel operations including customers, rooms, reservations, check-in/check-out details, payments, occupancy, and revenue analysis.

## Technologies Used

* MySQL
* MySQL Workbench
* SQL

## Database Features

* Customer management
* Room management
* Reservation management
* Check-in and check-out tracking
* Payment management
* Room occupancy analysis
* Revenue analysis

## SQL Concepts Used

* CREATE TABLE
* INSERT
* SELECT
* WHERE
* ORDER BY
* GROUP BY
* HAVING
* Aggregate Functions
* JOINs
* Subqueries
* Primary Keys
* Foreign Keys
* UNIQUE Constraints

